          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "The following  building shall be added:- TRING RURAL SP 91 SW                                                     GRAND UNION CANAL 4/171                                               AYLESBURY ARM                                                     LOCK NO. 4 II Canal lock.  1811-13 with later alterations.  Engineer Henry Provis for Grand Junction Canal Company.  Brick with granite quoins and coping, and some brick coping.  Narrow lock to take a single narrowboat.  Single gate at east end,   hinged at north side; double gate at west end; with paddles and winding gear. Datestones of 1853 and 1864, east gate dated 1985.  Brick-lined entrances. Listing NGR: SP9142614521"
    }
